    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In the metropolitan center of Seoul, the public image of actor Kim Soo-hyun—a beloved public figure and object of desire—was brutally tarnished. A content creator, motivated to violate trust for profit, spread fabricated intimacy narratives, using digital manipulation to allege the celebrity dated a minor co-star. The ensuing reputational damage forced the scandal-tarnished image into seclusion, halting professional engagements, until a public authority intervened with an arrest warrant, leading to the betrayer's detention.",
